{#
  ── THE PUBLIC SIDE HAD NO WAY TO SAY ANYTHING WENT WRONG ────────────────────

  The admin and judge layouts have rendered flash messages since the beginning.
  layout/gates.twig — the layout every public page and every member page uses —
  rendered none, so a public controller that set a message and redirected sent
  the visitor to a page that showed them nothing.

  That is not a missing nicety. It is indistinguishable from a broken link: you
  click "Apply for a stand", you land back on the page you came from, and the
  one sentence explaining why ("applications for this event are closed") was
  written to a session key with no reader. That is exactly how it was reported.

  Announced with role="status"/role="alert" rather than colour alone, because a
  message a screen reader never speaks is the same silent failure again.
#}
{% if flash_error or flash_ok or flash_notice %}
<div class="ag-flash-rail">
  {% if flash_error %}
    <div class="ag-flash ag-flash--error" role="alert">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg>
      <p>{{ flash_error }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if flash_ok %}
    <div class="ag-flash ag-flash--ok" role="status">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
      <p>{{ flash_ok }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if flash_notice %}
    <div class="ag-flash ag-flash--note" role="status">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 16v-5M12 8h.01"/></svg>
      <p>{{ flash_notice }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}
